1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:00,810
The Deck.

2
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:03,560
Your apps, people and tools,
one swipe in from the bar.

3
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:05,434
Swipe in from the tab.

4
00:00:05,474 --> 00:00:08,210
Swipe from the Dock toward
the middle of the screen.

5
00:00:08,250 --> 00:00:11,360
Out slides the Deck: your
people, your apps and your tools.

6
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:12,349
Tap a tile.

7
00:00:12,389 --> 00:00:13,790
Some tiles act at once.

8
00:00:13,830 --> 00:00:17,360
Flashlight switches the torch
on, and its tile lights up.

9
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:18,725
Or open a card.

10
00:00:18,765 --> 00:00:21,281
Others open a card beside the strip.

11
00:00:21,321 --> 00:00:24,760
Volume has sliders for
media, ringtone and alarm.

12
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:26,177
Start a timer.

13
00:00:26,217 --> 00:00:28,969
Tap Timer, pick a length and Start.

14
00:00:29,009 --> 00:00:32,160
It keeps counting after the Deck closes.

15
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:32,984
Close it.

16
00:00:33,024 --> 00:00:35,081
Tap anywhere outside, or press Back.

17
00:00:35,121 --> 00:00:37,760
Left alone, it closes
itself after 10 seconds.

18
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:39,967
Open the Deck settings.

19
00:00:40,007 --> 00:00:44,360
In Gesture Volume, under
Advanced features, tap Deck.

20
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:46,235
Turn tiles on or off.

21
00:00:46,275 --> 00:00:49,760
Tap Deck tiles and switch
on the ones you want.

22
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:53,360
Coin toss and Dice start
off; Screenshot can go.

23
00:00:53,700 --> 00:00:54,996
Add people to call.

24
00:00:55,036 --> 00:00:59,287
Back on the Deck screen, Quick
dial puts people in the strip:

25
00:00:59,327 --> 00:01:01,960
one tap calls them or opens a message.

26
00:01:02,300 --> 00:01:03,436
Toss a coin.

27
00:01:03,476 --> 00:01:07,749
Coin toss now waits at
the end of the strip:

28
00:01:07,789 --> 00:01:12,160
scroll down to it, tap
it, then tap the coin.

29
00:01:13,050 --> 00:01:17,510
Up next: Search in the Deck.
